    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- Zero water treatment plans to provide safe drinking water via the public network of water supply
2 - Zero of the residents in target communities have access to safe drinking water via the public network of water supply,</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- Zero water plants completely constructed (30 % works to be completed on Safwan Water Treatment Plant; and 15 % works to be completed on the two plants in Al Shouiba district).
2- Zero of beneficiaries get access to safe drinking water (awaiting the full construction of water treatment plants in 2022 and 2023).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">20% of works completed for Safwan Water Treatment Plant, and 20% of works completed for Al Shouiba district.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
